      en: ["The Jubba Hotel was built in the 1970s as a state-owned luxury hotel.", "Before 1991, it was considered the premier 4-star hotel in all of Somalia.", "The building is located in the Bondhere district near Villa Somalia.", "It featured more than 100 guest rooms and several conference halls.", "During the civil war, it was utilized as a strategic military base.", "The ruin is now a prominent landmark in the Mogadishu city skyline."],
